.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Every prime p \equiv 1 \pmod 4 is a sum of two squares a^2 + b^2, and no prime p \equiv 3 \pmod 4 is. This script checks the theorem for every prime below 10,000 and plots each representation as a lattice point (a, b) on the circle of radius \sqrt p.">

