.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Every non-negative integer is a sum of four squares. This script finds a representation for every n &lt; 10{,}000 and plots the fewest squares each n actually needs: one for perfect squares, two by Fermat&#x27;s criterion, four exactly for n = 4^k(8m+7) (Legendre&#x27;s three-square theorem), and three otherwise.">

